WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to ask,
on a day like today,

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.335 line:92%
where there is so much news --

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh.
-You have a show on Wednesday.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.505
-We do.
-Are you happy to have the time

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:08.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
to process it, or are you
chomping at the bit to do one?

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:12.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, we --
I felt so sorry for you today.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:13.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I did.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:15.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, because it
roils the news, and then --

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:17.350 size:81% position:41%
But it's nice for us
to be able to sit back

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
and kind of be
a little more analytical

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
and just kind of wait
to see what's happening.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
We get to take a step back
a little bit.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:25.592 line:92%
-Of course, stuff then also --

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:28.028 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's not like things
don't happen on Wednesday

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
that tip your apple cart over,
as well.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:30.797 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, I know.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, you know,
you have to be nimble.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:33.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
The news changed
within every hour.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:38.738
-He's made us very fit.
He's made us so aerobically fit.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:42.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Flexing such fun muscles
all the time.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:44.544 size:88% position:44%
-You addressed Kavanaugh
last week in your show.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.646
-We did.
-And obviously I'm gonna assume

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:48.048
you're going to address
him again this Wednesday.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.649 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For sure.
-Because that will be the eve

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
of this testimony
that we don't quite know

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:53.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
how it's gonna look.
-Yep.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it --
Have you found it

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:57.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
a difficult thing
to write comedy about?

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We have.
You know, it's something

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:01.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we're all really
wrestling with at the show.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think it's really
been very upsetting

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:07.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
and triggering for a lot of
people who work in the office.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.134 line:92%
I'm sure it has here, too.

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:10.537
I think that women, in general,
are just furious.

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:13.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
We totally took --
We took to the streets today.

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
We were, like,
wearing all black.

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:16.709
We were like, "Let's just go
and walk around the block."

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:19.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's what we did,
and it felt good for a moment.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.114 line:92%
-Yeah, I mean, you also find --

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I know we found
as a writing staff,

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
when things happen in the news
that are depressing,

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
it is nice to be in a room
full of comedy writers.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-You must find that, as well.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For sure.
I do think that we achieve

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:32.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
some kind -- we achieve
catharsis within the office.

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:34.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I don't know
that there is another job

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:35.361 line:92%
that all of us could be doing.

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:38.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's kind of the only job
we're capable of now,

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:39.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we help each other.
-Yeah.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:41.935
There's no matching skill sets
outside of comedy right now.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:45.872
-We are definitely useless
in every other endeavor.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:50.176
-Yeah. We would all be the worst
person at any other job.

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:52.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh. Definitely. Yes.

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:54.180 size:81% position:41%
-But I want to talk,
'cause we've -- we had

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.316
previous jobs,
like a lot of people in comedy,

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:59.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is that we --
I know I waited tables.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
You also waited tables.
-I definitely did.

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:03.189
-I've heard you say, and I would
think anybody would assume

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:06.826 align:start size:94% position:6%
your time at "The Daily Show"
has made you very --

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
helped train you
for what you're doing now.

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:09.129 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Sure.

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:12.532
-But that being a waiter was
very helpful for Donald Trump.

00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:13.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very.
Don't you think that --

00:02:13.867 --> 00:02:17.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, I mean, you see the best
and the worst of humanity

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
when you work
in the service industry.

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:21.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I feel like when I see him
I'm like, "Oh, I know you."

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:24.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Like, "I've seen you."

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:27.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're 100% the guy
who comes in, and he's like,

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.249 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"I'm an amazing tipper.

00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:30.850 line:92%
Take care of all of my friends."

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
And all his friends are like,
horrible,

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:34.721
and they're all gropers,
and then, right at the end,

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:37.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
he gives you, like,
a nice 8% tip.

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:38.758 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:40.593 line:92%
For sure, like a lot of talk.

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:43.530 line:92%
Lots of talk, very little rock.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.198 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:48.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have a new app
that is a game.

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:50.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We do!
We're so excited about it!

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:51.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is very exciting.
-It's very fun.

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:54.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And this is to encourage
voter registration.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:54.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
Well, okay.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:57.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had this idea that we should
apply the principles

00:02:57.243 --> 00:03:00.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
of gamification
to incentivize voter turnout.

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:05.919
Because as we are discovering,
voting is extremely important.

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:07.353 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:09.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so,
I went to Silicon Valley,

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:10.790 line:92%
and I met with a bunch of geeks,

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:14.394 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they helped us
to craft this amazing game,

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:17.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I really don't know
if it's ever been done before.

00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:20.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's really
a political comedy game,

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.668 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and you win cash prizes,

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:23.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you sign up
for voting reminders,

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:26.673
and it's all meant to trick you
into caring about voting,

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:29.342
and I think it's working.
-That's very exciting.

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:33.313
-We have 200,000 users,
and, actually, when we launched,

00:03:33.313 --> 00:03:36.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
it was very --
it was very successful

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:36.749 size:81% position:41% line:92%
right out of the gate.

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so the game
crashed a little bit,

00:03:38.251 --> 00:03:39.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
but we're very much
working on the bugs,

00:03:39.652 --> 00:03:41.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
but people are winning money,
and it's very cool.

00:03:41.888 --> 00:03:43.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's really funny.
-Well, it's great,

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:45.558
because the two things
that are true about Americans...

00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:46.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-...one, we don't like voting,

00:03:46.626 --> 00:03:48.728
and, two, we're easily tricked.
-Easily tricked.

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:50.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, if you can lure us
into anything...

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:54.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, we love to win a prize.
-Yeah.

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
What is --
I want to ask,

00:03:55.435 --> 00:03:56.603 size:75% position:38%
'cause that would be
intimidating to me.

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:58.471
You have an idea, and then
you go to Silicon Valley.

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:00.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
I have never sort of entered
that room with an idea.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.543
Was it intimidating for you?
-It was very intimidating,

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:04.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they work
in such a different way.

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:06.946
I mean, they literally --
we started at nothing,

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:10.850
and we assembled a really
amazing group of people.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.018 line:92%
But the way that they work --

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:13.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I know that
there's a term for it,

00:04:13.953 --> 00:04:14.821 line:92%
but I don't remember what it is.

00:04:14.821 --> 00:04:17.890
You all sit in a room,
and you do these massively long

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
brainstorming sessions
with, like, props,

00:04:19.993 --> 00:04:22.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
and somebody's got dice,
and there's a bunch of bananas

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:25.531 align:start size:94% position:6%
and post-it notes,
and they all just

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:28.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
throw out the worst ideas
humanly possible,

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:30.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it's a very
humiliating process.

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:32.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
You really just --
You have to give over

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:35.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the process
and let everybody share

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:37.343 line:92%
everybody's horrible ideas.

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:40.346 size:84% position:42%
And you end the day,
you've been humiliated,

00:04:40.346 --> 00:04:42.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you're like,
"Why are we doing this?"

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:43.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then,
a year later, you have a game.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
-Yeah. That's how it's --

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:46.552 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's just that simple.

00:04:46.552 --> 00:04:48.187
-Okay.
So that's also helpful to hear.

00:04:48.187 --> 00:04:48.988 line:92%
If you want to have an app,

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:50.723 align:start size:94% position:6%
you can't just think about it
like a day.

00:04:50.723 --> 00:04:52.425 line:92%
-No, it's a very long process.

00:04:52.425 --> 00:04:54.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's been
a really interesting journey.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.895 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's been
an incredible learning curve.

00:04:55.895 --> 00:04:58.398
I'm ultimately incredible happy
with the product.

00:04:58.398 --> 00:04:59.299 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I think it's so funny.

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:01.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's in the voice of the show.
-That's great.

00:05:01.167 --> 00:05:03.403 size:75% position:38%
-Yeah, super shrill.
-And I know it's --

00:05:03.403 --> 00:05:05.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can win cash prizes.
-Yes.

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:06.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But it does not count
as gambling,

00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:08.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
which would be illegal,
because you cannot lose money.

00:05:08.708 --> 00:05:11.210 size:84% position:42%
-You cannot lose money.
-You cannot lose money.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:12.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Got it.
-Techni--

00:05:12.078 --> 00:05:13.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, you cannot lose money.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:14.747 size:88% position:44%
We will not take your --
We will not take your --

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:16.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"I voted, and then I went
back to my app,

00:05:16.316 --> 00:05:17.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I had lost $1,000!"
-I know!

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:20.987
-We will not take your money,
and we will not abuse your data.

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:23.623 size:81% position:41%
We know how that goes.
-Oh, yes, absolutely.

00:05:23.623 --> 00:05:24.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
People like that.
-Yeah.

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:27.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You actually did have --
You briefly --

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
You ventured
a little down the path

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:32.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
into a life
in the gambling industry.

00:05:32.065 --> 00:05:33.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did.
I worked --

00:05:33.466 --> 00:05:35.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
I trained
when I was in college --

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:39.038 align:start size:94% position:6%
Um, I trained
to become a blackjack dealer

00:05:39.038 --> 00:05:43.476 size:81% position:41%
in an illegal casino
in an industrial park.

00:05:43.476 --> 00:05:44.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow!
-Yes.

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:46.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So the kind of illegal casino
where truly

00:05:46.579 --> 00:05:49.882 size:88% position:44%
only really shady people
even knew where it was.

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:52.952
-Definitely. And you have
to pay with your limbs.

00:05:52.952 --> 00:05:54.821 size:75% position:38%
I don't really know.
I could not do it.

00:05:54.821 --> 00:05:56.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
I actually --
How far down the path

00:05:56.222 --> 00:05:57.957
to being a blackjack dealer did
you get before you realized?

00:05:57.957 --> 00:06:00.159 size:78% position:39%
-Like, three days in.
And then I was like,

00:06:00.159 --> 00:06:02.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
"This is not --"
-That's a lot of days.

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:03.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was a lot of days.
It was --

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:04.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What was the day
where they were like,

00:06:04.931 --> 00:06:06.966
"And then, if they can't pay,
you need to hold their wrist

00:06:06.966 --> 00:06:09.869
like this, and then someone else
will have the cleaver"...

00:06:09.869 --> 00:06:14.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was a very scary and very
serious crowd of people.

00:06:14.307 --> 00:06:15.842 size:75% position:38% line:92%
It really was not --

00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:17.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
It did not speak
to my strengths.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.746 align:start size:94% position:6%
You should not --
I didn't want to go to --

00:06:19.746 --> 00:06:21.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"This job starts at midnight.

00:06:21.981 --> 00:06:24.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
Over here is a factory
where they make

00:06:24.317 --> 00:06:26.652 line:92%
wooden pallets for boxes."

00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:28.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it did not --
It was not safe.

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:30.757
-Do you ever wonder --
'Cause you did three days there.

00:06:30.757 --> 00:06:32.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
You probably met
some other trainees.

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:33.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did.
-Do you ever think that

00:06:33.593 --> 00:06:36.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's like, at the illegal
gambling warehouse,

00:06:36.429 --> 00:06:38.264
somebody goes,
"You know, she used to be here."

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:40.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-"She's one of us."

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:41.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah!
-"She was incompetent."

00:06:41.834 --> 00:06:44.137
I've been terrible at every job
I've ever done.

00:06:44.137 --> 00:06:46.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They're like, "I tell you,
when she was here,

00:06:46.105 --> 00:06:48.141 size:78% position:39%
I would not have said
she'd make an app."

00:06:48.141 --> 00:06:49.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-That's right.

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:50.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yes.
Yes.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:53.646 size:78% position:39%
I hope that everybody
is connecting those.

00:06:53.646 --> 00:06:56.315 line:92%
-Always so great to see you.

